  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>現在我們可以為馬匹添加翅膀了。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>手持<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#00f;text-decoration:underline\">鞘翅</span></span>對馬匹按右鍵即可安裝翅膀。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>現在是時候飛翔了！騎乘馬匹時按下「F」鍵就能飛行。<span style=\"font-size:14px\">（按鍵可自定義）</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>遺憾的是，你必須殺死馬匹才能取回<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#00f\">鞘翅</span> :(</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KPYsq0IJNmM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
